{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IMediaDataCenter/ILiveStreamManager_LiveStreamSettings_RtspSettings.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>RtspSettings</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">RtspSettings</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.datacenter.livestream.settings</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><a href=\"IMediaDataCenter.html\">IMediaDataCenter</a><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><a href=\"ILiveStreamManager.html\">ILiveStreamManager</a><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">RtspSettings</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">RtspSettings</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">It is used to build and get the RTSP live stream settings.</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.datacenter.livestream.settings</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.datacenter.livestream.settings\" aria-label=\"Copy package name\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"Description\" style=\"display: none;\">Description:</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">It is used to build and get the RTSP live stream settings.<br>\n<br><br>Please refer to the following example to obtain the live broadcast address.<br>\n<br><br>RTSP setting parameters are as follows:<br> Username: 123456<br> Password: 123<br> Port number: 8554<br> The ip address of the MSDK App installation device: 192.168.2.13<br></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<p><br>The live stream address is as follows:<br><br>\nrtsp://123456:123@192.168.2.13:8554/streaming/live/1<br>\n<br><br><code><i>Supported since MSDK 5.0.0</i></code></p>\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>Members</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">4</span> members</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"Filter by name, parameter or description\" aria-label=\"Filte